        },
        "quote": "If the application is in proper form and accompanied by the license fee, the Governing Body shall examine the application and, after examination of the application and certification as provided in TMC 5.55.100 , the Governing Body shall direct the City Clerk to issue a license to the applicant; provided, that no license shall be issued to:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "5693ee51-0bef-57a1-a04c-897b03a44e95",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 424,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:1",
          "start": 342
        },
        "quote": "(a) Character. A person who is not of good character and reputation in the County.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "d175ebc9-070b-5d2f-86d2-05a53a5077fe",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 493,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:2",
          "start": 425
        },
        "quote": "(b) Citizenship. A person who is not a citizen of the United States.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "3d78b8e8-c3d1-5924-8044-d886580c67b8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 922,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:3",
          "start": 494
        },
        "quote": "(c) Convictions. A person who within two years immediately preceding the date of making application has been convicted of, released from incarceration for or released from probation or parole for a felony or any crime involving moral turpitude, drunkenness, driving a motor vehicle while under the influence of intoxicating liquor or the violation of any other intoxicating liquor law of any city, state or of the United States.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "35fb2e19-31c4-52a6-9568-fb97c3e6f3aa",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1038,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:4",
          "start": 923
        },
        "quote": "(d) Partnership. A partnership, unless all members of such partnership are otherwise qualified to obtain a license.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "4f9481c6-ebd5-5107-89ef-3bf6bf68904b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1312,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:5",
          "start": 1039
        },
        "quote": "(e) Corporation. A corporation, if any manager, officer or director thereof, or any stockholder owning in the aggregate more than 25 percent of the stock of such corporation, would be ineligible to receive a license under this section for any reason other than citizenship.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "1c3a892e-27bc-504e-83d7-3b0375c36bc9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1681,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:6",
          "start": 1313
        },
        "quote": "(f) Interest in a Corporation with Revoked License. A person, partnership, or corporation if any manager, officer, or director, or any stockholder, owning in the aggregate more than 25 percent of the stock of such corporation, has been an officer, manager, director or a stockholder owning in the aggregate more than 25 percent of the stock of a corporation which has:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "ea2b82a1-de5c-5628-9cdd-6e1719c427cb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1766,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:7",
          "start": 1682
        },
        "quote": "(1) Had a retailer’s license revoked under K.S.A. 41-2708 and amendments thereto; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "c2c353a3-c759-580e-9866-e4026682f39d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1878,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:8",
          "start": 1767
        },
        "quote": "(2) Been convicted of a violation of the Drinking Establishment Act or the cereal malt beverage laws of Kansas.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "b4e0c063-f5a7-5374-a109-f654121e6fde",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2216,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:9",
          "start": 1879
        },
        "quote": "(g) Limited Liability Company. A limited liability company unless the company meets the qualifications for licensure of a corporation, except that only those individuals owning in the aggregate 25 percent or more of the ownership interest in the company shall be required to meet the qualifications for an individual to obtain a license.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "09a1e6ad-2458-5ec1-b5d8-1b5a5b378eae",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2239,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:10",
          "start": 2217
        },
        "quote": "(h) Ineligible Spouse.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "0c8b2b6d-ee4b-577b-9a09-52039e136b29",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2460,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:11",
          "start": 2240
        },
        "quote": "(1) A person whose spouse would be ineligible to receive a retailer’s license for any reason other than citizenship or age, except that this subsection shall not apply in determining eligibility for a renewal license; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "11371549-8383-5f37-b283-bdfc1be0d134",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2667,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:12",
          "start": 2461
        },
        "quote": "(2) A person whose spouse has been convicted of a felony or other crime which would disqualify a person from licensure and such felony or other crime was committed during the time the spouse held a license.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.55.070 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "240339bd-ecd2-50f0-99e8-ff036b36e6ac",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2869,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:13",
          "start": 2668
        },
        "quote": "(i) Manager or Agent. A person whose premises is to be conducted by a manager or agent, unless such manager or agent possesses the same qualifications required of a licensee. (Ord. 20302 § 1, 6-15-21.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.55.070:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
